{'symbol': 'DVN', 'date': '2019-12-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'DEVON ENERGY CORPORATION ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2020, PAYABLE ON MARCH 31, 2020', 'text': 'DEVON ENERGY CORP. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON DEVON’S COMMON STOCK FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2020. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 31, 2020, AT A RATE OF $0.09 PER SHARE BASED ON A RECORD DATE OF MARCH 13, 2020.'}